1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,700
Every enterprise has more ideas than it can build.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:11,635
Put AI inside ideation, and every idea can become a software system.

3
00:00:12,985 --> 00:00:15,195
AI writes code in minutes.

4
00:00:16,545 --> 00:00:20,000
An enterprise needs a system it trusts in production.

5
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:29,430
Akka is an AI platform that turns any idea into a system that is ready for production, and keeps it trustworthy once it runs.

6
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:39,790
Only Akka combines the path from an idea to a specification, the pipeline that builds and checks the system, and the runtime the system is built for.

7
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:47,715
Because the runtime is known before any code is generated, AI writes less, and reviewers review less.

8
00:00:49,065 --> 00:00:51,085
Every release carries a receipt.

9
00:00:52,465 --> 00:00:55,385
Every idea gets its own software factory.

10
00:00:57,065 --> 00:01:00,330
Akka is the platform for enterprise ideAItion.
